# OST UI

Visual system lives in `static/app.css` (`:root` tokens + Pico overrides). Do not add inline `style=""` (CSP `style-src 'self'`). UI copy is English.

Every page extends `base.html`. `main.container.page` already styles the title (`h1` + following `p.muted`).

Wrap content in existing primitives — do not invent new layout classes:

- **`.block-card`** — section (filters, tables, scan, admin). Alias: `.form-section` on item create/edit.
- **`.toolbar`** / `.actions-row` / `.action-bar` — buttons and search, `width: auto`.
- **`.empty-state`** — no rows. Do not nest inside `.block-card`.
- **`.chip`**, **`.inv-badge`**, **`.add-inline`**, **`.muted`**

```html
{% extends "base.html" %}
{% block content %}
<h1>Page title</h1>
<p class="muted">One-line purpose.</p>
<section class="block-card">
  <h2>Section</h2>
  <table>…</table>
</section>
{% endblock %}
```
